{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04261","headline":"秋日山行简梁大官 · 骆宾王","name":"秋日山行简梁大官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘马陟层阜，回首睇山川。\n攒峰衔宿雾，叠巘架寒烟。\n百重含翠色，一道落飞泉。\n香吹分岩桂，鲜云抱石莲。\n地偏心易远，致默体逾玄。\n得性虚游刃，忘言已弃筌。\n弹冠劳巧拙，结绶倦牵缠。\n不如从四皓，丘中鸣一弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}